stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loading : caller waits for module imports
    Loading --> Unavailable : import or data failure (caller message)
    Loading --> Detached : caller removes layout before mount
    Loading --> Unavailable : mount then clear or invalid snapshot
    Unavailable --> ReadyEmpty : valid empty snapshot
    ReadyEmpty --> ReadyWithMeetings : delayed valid rows arrive
    Unavailable --> ReadyWithMeetings : valid ready rows arrive
    ReadyWithMeetings --> PartialWithMeetings : partial snapshot arrives
    PartialWithMeetings --> ReadyWithMeetings : complete snapshot arrives
    ReadyWithMeetings --> MeetingEnded : render with end instant less than now
    MeetingEnded --> ReadyEmpty : next empty snapshot
    ReadyWithMeetings --> Unavailable : clear or invalid snapshot
    PartialWithMeetings --> Unavailable : clear or failure
    ReadyEmpty --> Unavailable : failure
    ReadyWithMeetings --> Detached : targets removed and observer disconnects
    Detached --> [*]
    note right of ReadyWithMeetings
      Sort numeric start instants; stable input order for ties.
      Upcoming includes end instant equal to now.
      Chicago day links and all-day literal dates stay unchanged.
      Time passage takes effect on render; no new timer.
    end note
